<%- include('partials/header',{title:'About'}) %><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="kicker">Our story</span><h1>Compassion turned into a movement.</h1><p>Founded in 2018, Cancer Support Network Foundation is a not-for-profit cancer care initiative based in Accra, Ghana.</p></div></section><section class="intro wrap"><div><span class="kicker">Our mission</span><h2>Reduce the burden of cancer through awareness, early action and human-centered support.</h2></div><div><p>CSNF was born out of compassion to care for and support people affected by cancer. We believe outcomes improve when people understand warning signs, access screening earlier, receive support during treatment and see survivorship represented with dignity and hope.</p><p>Our work connects community education, screening outreach, patient assistance, survivor celebrations and advocacy for stronger cancer care.</p></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">Leadership</span><h2>People behind the mission.</h2></div></div><div class="team-grid"><% team.forEach(m=>{ %><div class="team-card"><img src="<%= m.image %>" alt=""><h3><%= m.name %></h3><span><%= m.role %></span><p><%= m.bio %></p></div><% }) %></div></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
